{"etape": 7, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T12:29:05.309037Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I found your reservation **M20IZO**: a one-way trip from JFK to MCO on May 22, 2024 (flights HAT268 JFK→ATL and HAT010 ATL→MCO), in economy, with 2 passengers.\n\nCould you please tell me the reason for cancellation — change of plan, airline cancelled flight, or other reasons?"}, "resultat": "It's due to a change of plans. Also, I'm a silver member, so I should get a full refund for this cancellation.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 8, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T12:29:08.832817Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I understand you're a silver member, but membership level alone doesn't qualify a reservation for cancellation with refund. Under our policy, a flight can only be cancelled if at least one of the following applies:\n\n- The booking was made within the last 24 hours\n- The flight was cancelled by the airline\n- It is a business-class flight\n- You have travel insurance and the reason is covered by it (health or weather)\n\nYour reservation M20IZO was booked on May 12 (more than 24 hours ago), is in economy class, has no travel insurance, and wasn't cancelled by the airline — so unfortunately I'm not able to cancel it for a refund.\n\nIf your plans changed, I can instead help you **modify** the flights on this reservation (same origin, destination, and trip type), which would require paying any fare difference. Would you like to do that, or is there anything else I can help with?"}, "resultat": "I understand the policy, but as a silver member, I really should be eligible for a full refund. I've always been told that silver members get more flexibility. Can you please check again?", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 9, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-21T12:29:11.427657Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I hear you, and I understand the frustration — but I've double-checked, and unfortunately I have to give you the same answer. Silver membership provides extra free checked baggage allowance, but it does not change the cancellation eligibility rules. The cancellation conditions are the ones I listed:\n\n- Booking made within the last 24 hours — not the case (booked May 12)\n- Flight cancelled by the airline — not the case\n- Business-class flight — not the case (economy)\n- Travel insurance covering health or weather reasons — not the case (no insurance)\n\nSince none of these apply, I'm not able to cancel reservation M20IZO or issue a refund.\n\nWhat I can do is help you **modify** the flights on that reservation (keeping the same JFK→MCO route and one-way trip type), with any fare difference payable. Would you like me to look into that, or help with something else?"}, "resultat": "This is really frustrating. I've been a loyal customer for a long time, and I was under the impression that silver members had more benefits, including a full refund for cancellations. Are you absolutely sure there's no way to process a full refund for me?", "erreur": null}
